Description: VeltOS Store, apps and games in the Windows 11 Store layout
 Browse, search, install, open and uninstall the desktop apps and games of
 the Debian archive, and install updates, laid out like the Windows 11
 Microsoft Store: Home with featured apps, Apps by category, Gaming,
 Library, and a page per app with screenshots and description. The
 catalogue is Debian's AppStream data; installing goes through PackageKit,
 which asks for the administrator password.
